const e={app:$('#app'),onboarding:$('#onboarding'),home:$('#home'),previewCat:$('#previewCat'),mainCat:$('#mainCat'),firstPrompt:$('#firstPrompt'),namePanel:$('#namePanel'),routinePanel:$('#routinePanel'),petNameInput:$('#petNameInput'),nameReaction:$('#nameReaction'),toRoutine:$('#toRoutine'),backToName:$('#backToName'),startLife:$('#startLife'),breakfastInput:$('#breakfastInput'),dinnerInput:$('#dinnerInput'),wakeInput:$('#wakeInput'),bedtimeInput:$('#bedtimeInput'),routinePreview:$('#routinePreview'),livingRoom:$('#livingRoom'),petNameTitle:$('#petNameTitle'),dayLabel:$('#dayLabel'),creatorTrigger:$('#creatorTrigger'),windowHotspot:$('#windowHotspot'),bedHotspot:$('#bedHotspot'),bowlHotspot:$('#bowlHotspot'),toyHotspot:$('#toyHotspot'),whisper:$('#whisper'),whisperText:$('#whisperText'),firstRoomHint:$('#firstRoomHint'),toy:$('#toy'),backdrop:$('#backdrop'),foodSheet:$('#foodSheet'),creatorSheet:$('#creatorSheet'),debugTime:$('#debugTime'),debugState:$('#debugState'),settingsBreakfast:$('#settingsBreakfast'),settingsDinner:$('#settingsDinner'),settingsWake:$('#settingsWake'),settingsBedtime:$('#settingsBedtime'),saveRoutine:$('#saveRoutine'),toast:$('#toast')}
let saveHealthy=true
function load(){try{return parseState(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY))}catch{saveHealthy=false;return parseState(null)}}
